{
  "_说明": [
    "对话注入测试。用法: 控制台 custom.inject_dialogue test_talk，然后跟任意NPC交谈。",
    "",
    "═══ v2 结构说明 ═══",
    "Transition 只管路由，NPC 台词统一在 DialogueNode.NpcLine。",
    "每个 node 有唯一 Id，NPC 说一句话，下面挂多个 transition。",
    "每个 transition 的 NextNodeOnSuccess 指向下一个 node 的 Id——不同选项可以走向完全不同的后续对话。",
    "NextNodeOnSuccess = null 表示这条线到此结束（直接关窗）。",
    "CheckType: None = 无检定直连 / SkillCheck = 有技能检定分叉（NextNodeOnSuccess/NextNodeOnFail）。",
    "EntryNode 指定对话从哪个 node 开始。",
    "",
    "图示:",
    "  [injectedStart]  NPC: 啊，你来得正好！",
    "    ├─ 选项「什么怪事？」   → NextNodeOnSuccess: more_detail",
    "    ├─ 选项「我没空」       → NextNodeOnSuccess: null (结束)",
    "    └─ 选项「有什么好处？」 → NextNodeOnSuccess: give_gold_ack",
    "  [give_gold_ack] NPC: 你果然是个精明人——100第纳尔，怎么样？",
    "    └─ → NextNodeOnSuccess: more_detail",
    ""
  ],

  "InjectAtToken": null,
  "EntryOption": "（闲聊）最近村子附近有点不对劲……",
  "EntryNode": "injectedStart",

  "Nodes": [
    {
      "Id": "injectedStart",
      "NpcLine": "啊，你来得正好！我最近遇到了一件怪事……",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "什么怪事？说来听听。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "more_detail"
        },
        {
          "PlayerLine": "我没时间管闲事。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "busy_ack"
        },
        {
          "PlayerLine": "帮你处理这件事，有什么好处？",
          "Action": "INTENT:GiveGold",
          "ActionParam": "100",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "give_gold_ack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "busy_ack",
      "NpcLine": "也是……打扰了。",
      "Transitions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": "give_gold_ack",
      "NpcLine": "你果然是个精明人——100第纳尔，怎么样？",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "…",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "more_detail"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "more_detail",
      "NpcLine": "而且不止如此——前天夜里，我亲眼看见有人影从粮仓后面窜出来，还带着火把！",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "这确实可疑。我帮你查查。",
          "Action": "INTENT:IncreaseRelation",
          "ActionParam": "5",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "investigate_ack"
        },
        {
          "PlayerLine": "你有仇家吗？会不会是冲着你来的？",
          "Action": "INTENT:IncreaseRelation",
          "ActionParam": "3",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "enemy_ack"
        },
        {
          "PlayerLine": "别疑神疑鬼的，说不定只是野猫。",
          "Action": "INTENT:DecreaseRelation",
          "ActionParam": "2",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "dismiss_ack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "investigate_ack",
      "NpcLine": "太感谢了！我会在村里等你消息。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "…",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "enemy_ack",
      "NpcLine": "仇家……倒是有几个。让我想想……村里张三上个月因为地界的事跟我闹过，李四也一直对我家那片林子虎视眈眈。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "…",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "ask_enemy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "dismiss_ack",
      "NpcLine": "野猫可不会带火把……但也许你是对的，我再观察几天。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "…",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "ask_enemy",
      "NpcLine": "你这么一说，张三那个家伙确实可疑。上个月他还放话说要让我好看……你能帮我去他家附近看看吗？",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "行，我去探探虚实。",
          "Action": "INTENT:IncreaseRelation",
          "ActionParam": "5",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "explore_ack"
        },
        {
          "PlayerLine": "这是你们之间的私人恩怨，我不掺和。",
          "Action": "INTENT:DecreaseRelation",
          "ActionParam": "1",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "refuse_ack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "explore_ack",
      "NpcLine": "拜托你了！他家在村子东头，那个红顶的房子就是。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "…",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "refuse_ack",
      "NpcLine": "好吧……我理解。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "…",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "goodbye"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "goodbye",
      "NpcLine": "无论如何，跟你聊过之后我心里踏实多了。如果你以后在村子附近看到可疑的人，请一定来告诉我。",
      "Transitions": [
        {
          "PlayerLine": "我会留意的。",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "goodbye_ack"
        },
        {
          "PlayerLine": "别指望我免费当保安。",
          "Action": "INTENT:DecreaseRelation",
          "ActionParam": "3",
          "NextNodeOnSuccess": "rude_ack"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "Id": "goodbye_ack",
      "NpcLine": "谢谢你，愿主保佑你。",
      "Transitions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": "rude_ack",
      "NpcLine": "……我明白了。",
      "Transitions": []
    }
  ]
}
